= News
Announcements, newest first

Only the newest four entries are shown on the [index.html Home] page.

== 2026

- *2026-09-05* \M Two papers accepted at the Example International Conference on
  Communications (EICC 2026). Congratulations to all co-authors!
- *2026-08-21* \M Our journal paper "Learning-based power control for interference-limited
  networks" has been accepted in /Example Transactions on Wireless Communications/.
- *2026-06-30* \M The group received a two-year research grant on reconfigurable intelligent
  surfaces. See [awards.html Awards & Grants].
- *2026-05-12* \M Welcome to two new PhD students who joined the group this semester.
- *2026-03-02* \M New course material for the undergraduate course on wireless communications
  is now available on the [courses.html Courses] page.

== 2025

- *2025-11-18* \M Invited talk at the Example Workshop on Future Wireless Networks.
- *2025-09-01* \M The group website was relaunched (this site).
- *2025-04-07* \M Best paper award at the Example Symposium on Network Optimization.
- *2025-01-15* \M Two undergraduate honors students joined the group for their theses.

